      "text": "\n"
    },
    {
      "line": 555,
      "text": "#### Affected Endpoints\n"
    },
    {
      "line": 556,
      "text": "1. `GET /api/users/<user_id>` - Returns any user's data without authorization\n"
    },
    {
      "line": 557,
      "text": "2. `GET /api/profile/<user_id>` - Returns any user's profile without ownership check\n"
    },
    {
      "line": 558,
      "text": "3. `POST /api/devices` - Allows creating devices for arbitrary `owner_id`\n"
