    {
      "line": 635,
      "text": "| Unsalted SHA-256 password hashing | `auth.py:6-11` | Rainbow table attacks, GPU cracking |\n"
    },
    {
      "line": 636,
      "text": "| 1-year JWT expiration | `main.py:96` | Long-lived tokens, no revocation |\n"
    },
    {
      "line": 637,
      "text": "| Secret key in token | `auth.py:20` | Key exposure = total compromise |\n"
    },
    {
      "line": 638,
      "text": "| Hardcoded DB credentials | `prod.yaml:4-5` | Credential theft from config |\n"
    },
    {
